load @term/seed/code/algebra/lie
  find lie-algebra

# The Lorentz algebra: the Lie algebra of the symmetries of spacetime, the rotations and boosts that preserve the
# spacetime interval. It is the infinitesimal form of the Lorentz group, and its representations classify the spins of
# particles. In the substrate the continuous Lorentz symmetry is emergent, the coarse-grained shadow of the discrete F4
# symmetry of the cell restored in the large. The form carries the underlying Lie algebra.
form lorentz-algebra
  link algebra, like lie-algebra
